# Witness: a required formal separates the two declarations: a call with one value selects the one without a required formal (R82)
# Norm: the book #declaration-selection (its table), #admission; the plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan item 1; R65-R68, R71, R76.
# Slice «selection of the declaration by the call» (plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]

fn: f (int: a) int
    return: a
fn: f (int: a; required: int: b) int
    return: a * 10 + b

sub: main () (
    int: k 0
)
    shared\Observed\seen := f(5)
main()
